[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/bead_show_speed.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-en[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-en/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop re-probing git remotes and re-merging config in repo [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]inventory[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]inventory[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]inventory: memoize the per-primary git-origin probe and the sidecar [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]identity/config derivation that collect_repo_inventory recomputes [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hundreds of times per command, with an explicit reset hook for the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]long-lived ACE TUI, and guard it with a subprocess-count regression [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Build only the invoked command's subparser[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]parser[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]parser: give create_parser an opt-in only= hint so a normal sase <cmd> [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]run registers just that command's subparser, drive it from a single [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared command registry so the full and narrow paths cannot drift, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stop parser_artifact from importing the heavy artifact facade for one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tuple of argparse choices.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Resolve bead detail from one bead-store read[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]store[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]store: add a single-pass bead detail read to the Rust core and its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]binding so sase bead show reduces the event store once instead of three [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]times, and route the Python detail resolver through it.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end budget guard and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]after inventory, parser, store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]guard: assert the combined end-to-end cost ceiling and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]output-identity invariant across formats, then record the new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]performance characteristics in the changelog and bead docs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-en","hidden":false,"llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-en.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-93e5bd83a255fcaba6a1ddde50fbde52","started_at":"2026-08-03T08:50:55.180939","state":"dismissed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785764420,"sha":"e5208ec977cbe6974ccfa32526f4197b697caf1e","subject":"perf(cli): build only the invoked command parser"}],"dismissed_at":"2026-08-03T09:41:03.635998","files":{"chat":{"digest":"1bec21207d9df8147a20dcd1cd12e17a9490291ee55ed8814079b5c4e15b8826","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-en.2/chat.md","size_bytes":12498},"commits":{"digest":"8325477353d0949b6cc227ec80a38688d96b9557527347ec3efcf0d114eb6725","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-en.2/commits.json","size_bytes":226},"meta":{"digest":"3782bce9bf70d3c0b2a614fed7b633e99ed14548c3e82cc9c0b8a803cee30d43","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-en.2/meta.json","size_bytes":558},"state":{"digest":"34fb6bf5ee94f1ac2e094a1a37a6fab883a05dd05cb14186f0626609cdbfabaf","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-en.2/state.json","size_bytes":225}},"finished_at":"2026-08-03T09:41: